msgstr "Total:"

#: log-cleaner-ithemes.php:246
msgid "Clear logs"
msgstr "Limpiar registros"

#: log-cleaner-ithemes.php:246
msgid "This is your last chance. Are you sure?"
msgstr "Esta es tu última oportunidad. ¿Estás seguro?"

#: log-cleaner-ithemes.php:251
msgid "All logs are clear."
msgstr "Todos los registros están limpios."

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Delete Kadence Security (formerly Solid Security / iThemes Security) logs "
"from the database."
msgstr ""
"Elimina los registros de Kadence Security (antes Solid Security / iThemes "
"Security) de la base de datos."

